{"thread":{"threadID":4371,"boardID":13,"topic":"Endless Frontier - DREAM","time":1490357753,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","lastPostTime":1490800678,"lastPoster":"ifZ4ne","replies":18,"views":969,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":2},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":63990,"threadID":4371,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","subject":"Endless Frontier - DREAM","time":1490357753,"lastEditTime":1490483246,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":2106,"editor":"ifZ4ne","likes":[{"userID":2,"username":"Sky","time":1490402447,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1490476325,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo Dream,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>ich habe heute bei dem Mobil Idle RPG eine Gilde eröffnet mit dem Namen Dream, also falls jemand von euch Endless Frontier, Semi Aktiv Idled, ist er herzlich Willkommen. Bei Fragen könnt ihr mich auch gerne kontaktieren oder in den Thread antworten.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Hier ein Paar Infos zum Spiel, wenn ihr neu Anfangen wollt und mit machen wollt :<br><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/EndlessFrontier/comments/5e7m20/endless_frontier_faq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ansonsten gibt es nicht viel zusagen, es ist halt ein Idle RPG wo man relativ &quot;0&quot; macht.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ihr müsst auf SERVER 6 spielen, um der Gilde beizutreten</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Mfg ifZ4ne</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ps: Nein kein Pay2win, ihr bekommt Diamanten in den Arsch geschoben :), einfach jeden Tag einloggen. (20 Tag infolge = 10400 Dias)</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64018,"threadID":4371,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1490401959,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1490409045,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hab von Idle Spielen genug, seitdem ich hunderte Stunden mit den mathematisch schnellsten Runs an Clicker Heroes verbracht habe <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64044,"threadID":4371,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1490459050,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Man hat in dem Spiel mehr als genug zu tun. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😐</span> Und es ist trotzdem Pay2 Win... ich sag nur Ehrenmünzen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64045,"threadID":4371,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","subject":"","time":1490461602,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>habe ich bis jetzt nie wirklich dringend gebraucht, high tier artefakte bekomme ich auch so zusammen <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64046,"threadID":4371,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1490468853,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ja. Aber wenn du kohle zahlst kommst du 100x schneller vorran. Was isn deine höchste stufe?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64047,"threadID":4371,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","subject":"","time":1490470022,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Atm 2569 Level 26, 14,2 b (1420000) Medalien, bin seit gut 3 Wochen Semi Aktiv dabei, ist eigentlich ganz unterhaltsam vorallem das man eigentlich nichts Zahlen muss um gut vorran zu kommen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64050,"threadID":4371,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1490479275,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hab glaube ich 2700 Stufen geschafft und 70b Medals.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64051,"threadID":4371,"userID":335,"username":"Cornflakes","subject":"","time":1490482821,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>ab wann kann ich denn in gilden? Und wo sind sie zu finden? Grad installiert.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64052,"threadID":4371,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","subject":"","time":1490483128,"lastEditTime":1490483461,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":2106,"editor":"ifZ4ne","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>ab level 1, also <s>sofort</s> du kannst nach dem du Level 300 geschafft hast gilden joinen und gilden findest du oben rechts, dort ist so ein kleines wappen</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Edit : gar nicht bedacht das des Server gibt. falls die Gilden nicht Server übergreifend sind, Server 6 für die Gilde <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64053,"threadID":4371,"userID":335,"username":"Cornflakes","subject":"","time":1490483662,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>ok dauert nochn bisschen. xD</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64054,"threadID":4371,"userID":2408,"username":"KlitschkoS","subject":"","time":1490513863,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Auf PC oder handy?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64055,"threadID":4371,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","subject":"","time":1490519214,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Handy</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64121,"threadID":4371,"userID":2373,"username":"Hades","subject":"","time":1490624665,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":